WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Only images signed with the Key Vault key may run. A harmless unsigned image is turned away at admission.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Architecture: Pipeline and runtime view.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Architecture: Admission sequence.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
An ECDSA P-256 signing key is created. In the pipeline this key lives in Azure Key Vault.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Two harmless synthetic images are built and identified by digest.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Only the release image is signed, and the signature verifies.

7
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Admission decisions: the unsigned, tag-only and tampered images are rejected; the signed image is admitted.

8
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Verified result. Source, tests and setup steps are linked below.
